    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d419">

                <pb facs="1180" n="1174" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1174"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-09-10"><hi rendition="#italic">September 10,
                        1890</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a copy of the letter of the
                    Secretary of the Navy and a copy of the report therewith on the serious
                    political situation in Hawaii, which, as confirmatory of your No. 30, of the
                    19th ultimo, will doubtless be read with interest.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d419-a1.xml" xpointer="d419-a1"/>
